    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44141" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐίλᾰτ-ος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵλημι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>very
			merciful</i>, of deities, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				34.19
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				3.73
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>GDI</u>
				3543
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Cnidus</span>), etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐ. ἐγένου αὐτοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ps.</u>
					98(99).8
				</span></i>
			; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τυχεῖν εὐιλάτου τοῦ βασιλέος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PPetr.</u>
					2p.45
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; later written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐειλ</span>- <i><span class="en">
				<u>GDI</u>
				3536
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Cnidus</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>UPZ</u>
				109.6
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐιλᾰτ-εύω</span></b> , <i>to be merciful</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>De.</u>
				29.20(19)
			</span></i>, al.</div>
